As a system, I want a hybrid debate engine so that agents first think independently and then challenge each other in structured rounds.

Acceptance Criteria
Round 1 (Parallel)
All agents respond to same input
No access to other agent outputs
Round 2 (Sequential)
Strategist response first
Risk Analyst critiques Strategist + Engineer
Engineer responds with counterpoints
Round 3 (Optional)
Agents refine answers based on contradictions
Moderator Stage
Receives full transcript
Generates final synthesis
manage rounds
store transcript
control execution order
pass outputs between agents